# Vite mode file for the LOCAL escape-pod-intro playable build (`npm run preview:intro`).
# Loaded by `vite build --mode intro` / `vite preview --mode intro`. Replaces the dead
# Netlify preview (usage limit, 2026-07-01) with a one-command local equivalent:
#   npm run preview:intro   →  build with the intro ON + serve at http://localhost:4173/
# The master GitHub-Pages build (plain `npm run build`, mode=production) is untouched —
# the intro stays OFF there. See docs/deploy-preview.md.
VITE_ESCAPE_POD_INTRO=1
